        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If a qualified employee is identified and selected for an MPOP position pursuant to Paragraphs 3 through 6, inclusive, the selected employee(s) will be permanently transferred to the MPOP and will receive Permanent Transfer expense treatment in accordance with contract provisions in effect at the time of the transfer.",
