        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "10 The selected employee will maintain the wage schedule from his/her originating Base Location per Article 12, Paragraph 4(b)(2) through 4(b)(2)(iv) At the expiration of the time periods set forth in Paragraphs 4(b)(2)/4(b)(2)(iv), employees assigned to an MPOP location will assume the wage schedule of the closest Base Location within 100 miles of the MPOP. If there is no Base Location within 100 miles of the MPOP, it will be assigned Wage Schedule 2.",
